		<description><![CDATA[I met Hakim at the Abode , during my first stay there (1989) and later again at my return from 1996 till 2001 
My most vivid memory was when my son Connor exclaimed in the Abode dining room &quot; Dad you are weird &quot; and Hakim replied beside me &quot; Better weird than boring &quot; ...
Hakim studied under Timothy Leary and could tell  great stories ..]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I met Hakim at the Abode , during my first stay there (1989) and later again at my return from 1996 till 2001<br />
My most vivid memory was when my son Connor exclaimed in the Abode dining room &#8221; Dad you are weird &#8221; and Hakim replied beside me &#8221; Better weird than boring &#8221; &#8230;<br />
Hakim studied under Timothy Leary and could tell  great stories ..</p>
]]></content:encoded>
